SUMMARY:Miel San Marcos Conference 2026
LOCATION:Terrace Theater - Long Beach Convention and Entertainment Center\,
 
 Long Beach
DESCRIPTION:Guatemalan worship band Miel San Marcos will hold its Miel San 
 
Marcos Conference 2026\, titled "El Lugar Más Alto\," at the Terrace Theat
 
er in downtown Long Beach on Friday\, Nov. 6 and Saturday\, Nov. 7\, 2026. 
 
The two-day gathering brings a Spanish-language act with 3 million monthly 
 
Spotify listeners and 2.8 million YouTube subscribers into the region with 
 
the largest concentration of Guatemalan Americans in the country\, drawing 
 
a national-scale audience for a full weekend rather than a single night. Mi
 
el San Marcos formed in 1998 when three brothers\, Josh\, Luis and Samy Mor
 
ales\, began leading worship at their church in San Marcos\, Guatemala. Nea
 
rly every album the band has released was recorded live in front of a congr
 
egation. The group has won Dove Awards and Arpa Awards and earned a nominat
 
ion at the Latin Grammy Awards. Signature songs also include "Bienvenido Es
 
píritu Santo\," "Danzo en el Río\," "Increíble" and "Proezas." The two-d
 
ay format brings o Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/miel-san-ma
 
rcos-conference-2026-long-beach-california-11-07-2026/event/0B006519C58C6AE
 
