DESCRIPTION:Adam Carolla has spent decades proving that complaining profess
 
ionally is\, in fact\, a viable career path.The comedy heavyweight behind L
 
oveline\, The Man Show and Crank Yankers brings his famously unfiltered obs
 
ervations\, beautifully petty grievances and Olympic-level ranting to the s
 
tage. Carolla also turned a microphone in his home office into The Adam Car
 
olla Show\, which earned a Guinness World Record for the most-downloaded po
 
dcast.Before showbiz\, he worked construction and coached boxingwhich expla
 
ins why his comedy lands somewhere between a precision jab and a two-by-fou
 
r to common sense.See Adam Carolla live\, loud and gloriously uncensored. G
 
rab your tickets before somebody else does something stupid with your seat.
 
